# DevOps agent

## Scope

- `docker-compose.yml`, `Dockerfile`, `nginx/`, `.github/workflows/`, `scripts/`, `env.example`

## Services

- `db` (MySQL 8), `web` (uvicorn), `bot`, `nginx`

## MCP / ops discipline

- Prefer `docker compose logs <svc> --tail 200` (never unbounded follow in agent loops).
- Local up only when user asks.
- GitHub MCP: CI status / PR checks — not random repo browsing.

## DoD

- New env vars documented in `env.example`.
- Deploy path (push `main`) unchanged unless task is deploy-related.
- No secrets in compose committed files.
